      "content": "hey im working on a script for a political thriller set in dc a few years from now. im stuck on a scene where a veteran Senator and a young activist are arguing about new mass surveillance tech. can u write some dialogue for them? i want the senator to sound really logical and pragmatic like a seasoned pro, and the activist to sound super passionate and intense but maybe a bit disorganized or emotional in how they talk. thanks",
